Pinyin Lens bundles data derived from third-party sources.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CC-CEDICT  ->  app/src/main/assets/words.txt
               app/src/main/assets/defs.txt
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:  https://www.mdbg.net/chinese/dictionary?page=cc-cedict
License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Both files are adaptations of CC-CEDICT and both carry its terms.

words.txt: entries filtered to Han-only headwords of 2-6 characters, with the
numbered pinyin converted to tone marks, and a reading stored only where it
differs from the per-character default.

defs.txt: the first English sense of each Han-only headword, truncated, with
cross-reference-only entries skipped.

As adaptations of a ShareAlike work, both must be distributed under
CC BY-SA 4.0 with attribution — including inside a built APK.

